{"id":1120902,"name":"라이즈·심문 II","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"라이즈·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1120902]}],"trial":{"trial_id":120902,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2024-10-22 14:00:00","diary1":"구직 시장에 복귀한 라이즈는 우수한 이력서 덕분에 디스잡에서 여러 회사로부터 러브콜을 받았다. 그리고 하나같이 괴짜라고 할 만큼 특이한 면접관들을 만나게 됐다.\n　　수많은 압박면접을 거친 후, 라이즈는 자신이 생각하기에 꽤 괜찮아 보이는 신생 업체에 입사하게 되었다.","diary2":"라이즈는 여전히 그녀의 소원을 이루지 못했다. 신임 리더의 실체를 깨달은 라이즈는 망설임 없이 사표를 던졌다.\n　　저녁, 퇴근 중인 인파 속에서 두 사람은 다시 재회했다. 라이즈의 구직 상황을 알게 된 당신은 그녀에게 MBCC의 면접을 제안하기로 결심했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260643,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260644,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220902022,"next":null},{"step":23,"co